&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You are proactive, when you see something broken you jump on it to fix it or suggest improvements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You strive to use best practices and always test the software that you deliver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
