&lt;li&gt;Create purchase orders for internal departments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide administrative support to employees for the enrollment and processing of benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular audits of employment files and systems to ensure they are up-to-date, accurate, and GDPR compliant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually work to better our processes, spotting areas we can improve to drive our function forward.&lt;/li&gt;
