&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solving and the ability to innovate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communications skills in English, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects or product lines while maintaining focus on key priorities&lt;/li&gt;
