&lt;li&gt;Excellent communications skills, both verbal and written, in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leader and problem solver with extensive experience building successful internal and external partnerships and effective working relationships with demanding project sponsors in complex organizational environments&lt;/li&gt;
