&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in communications with proven achievements in the AR field and market research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing technology communications (agency or in-house) or global AR programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering innovative and successful communications campaigns in the technology space, and enhancing company positioning through AR programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cloud/SaaS/open source technology&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical eye and the ability to develop measurement frameworks to inform decision making at leadership level&lt;/li&gt;
