&lt;p&gt;The company is founder led, profitable and growing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are hiring a senior design manager to play a key role making open source software available to the world. Our Design function ensures the experience of the software and infrastructure we build is true to our intentions, and delivers the tools our community and customers need. The Design Manager makes this possible through leadership within, and beyond, our teams.&lt;/p&gt;
