&lt;li&gt;Leading and developing a team of revenue operations analysts in developing policies, driving processes and providing daily operational support and enablement to sales teams and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving Sales Engagement, Training/Enablement/Data Enrichment, Customer Relationship Management, Configure Price Quote, Analytics and Commissions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrumenting, measuring and improving policies and processes across teams covering the entire revenue operations spectrum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering metrics and reporting to monitor and improve revenue operations effectiveness, including new leads, pipeline, velocity, sales productivity and renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using data to drive insight, manage territories and channels, improve productivity, and agree and implement actionable change with executive management through regular sales and business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
