&lt;li&gt;Improve roadmap clarity, planning, and execution across the team&#39;s portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver meaningful improvements to Ubuntu&#39;s package management and system lifecycle platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
