&lt;li&gt;Prospect through email, cold calls, LinkedIn, and other creative outbound channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run strong discovery, demo, and evaluation processes with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly communicate Amplemarket’s value to sales leaders, revenue teams, and executive buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage deal progression with rigor, including qualification, follow-up, objection handling, and next step precision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with leadership to refine messaging, outbound strategy, and territory execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong CRM hygiene, forecasting accuracy, and pipeline discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share market feedback to help improve positioning, process, and product insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as an Account Executive in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of closing net-new business and consistently performing against quota&lt;/li&gt;
