&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into sales, growth, or revenue organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools like Salesforce, HubSpot, Outreach, Salesloft, Apollo, ZoomInfo, Unify, 6sense, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Gong, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup or high-growth company experience&lt;/li&gt;
