&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for designing, building, and maintaining the infrastructure and processes necessary for the collection, storage, and analysis of large datasets. You will work closely with our development, product, and data teams to ensure that our data is accurate, reliable, and accessible to support business decision-making, machine learning models, and drive product innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
