&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Identify and close new business opportunities — whether expanding usage within existing accounts or acquiring net-new customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Meet and exceed quarterly and annual sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Manage all aspects of the sales process: discovery, demos, proofs of concept, proposals, negotiations, and account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Clearly communicate the value of Grafana Cloud and Grafana Enterprise to technical and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain a clean, accurate pipeline in Salesforce and manage forecasting, quoting, and order processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
