&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Outbound prospecting into net-new customers&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Manage all aspects of the sales process (prospecting, sales meetings, product demos, proofs of concept, proposals, and negotiations)&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
