&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Social Media and Influencer Relations Associate, you&#39;ll help shape how Grafana Labs shows up across social media, executive thought leadership, and the technical creator community. You&#39;ll partner closely with Social Media, PR, Content, Product Marketing, Community, Events, and Developer Relations to create engaging content, grow our influencer program, support executive social, and build AI-assisted workflows that help our team work smarter. We&#39;re looking for a curious, collaborative self-starter who enjoys wearing multiple hats, thrives in a fast-paced environment, and is excited to combine creativity with thoughtful execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and evolve the company’s influencer relations and content creator program, including strategy, recruitment, onboarding, budgeting, relationship management, and reporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop social media plans for spokespeople, helping translate industry trends, product narratives, and leadership perspectives into thoughtful social content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, edit, and publish leaders’ social content across channels such as LinkedIn and X&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Sr. Social Media Manager in managing the employee advocacy program to amplify key messages through our Grafanistas&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize AI-assisted workflows to support content development, campaign planning, and stakeholder collaboration, while maintaining strong human judgment and editorial oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with social, PR, community, product marketing, events, and developer relations to identify creator opportunities and integrate influencer efforts, executive social media programs, and employee advocacy into broader campaigns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Sr. Social Media Manager with social content creation and adaptation across Grafana Labs’ social channels — short-form video and campaign toolkits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help manage, schedule, and publish Grafana Labs’ award-winning Big Tent podcast&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal communications coordination, helping to amplify team achievements and corporate milestones through appropriate internal channels&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a flexible partner on high-priority PR moments, providing additional support where needed across planning, writing, coordination, amplification, and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide on-site support at company and industry events, including staffing executive and customer interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Communications, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 4 years of marketing experience, preferably in social media marketing or public relations at a fast-growing start-up&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building AI workflows using tools such as Claude Code to enhance brainstorming and optimize processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication abilities and strong interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel (~20%) globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Sprout Social, Brandwatch, BusinessWire (or similar tools)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2 years of video-editing experience with tools like Descript, Premiere (or similar)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and as part of a globally distributed team in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn and adapt to new marketing trends and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of developing high-impact influencer campaigns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
